put('edmonton-policy-b14-01g-reduced-zero-lot-line-detached-garages','B14-01G – Reduced or Zero Lot Line Detached Garages','policy','ABC 2014','2019-01-10','Provides a paired-lot deemed limiting-distance construction route for eligible detached garages/accessory buildings.','Edmonton detached garages/accessory buildings serving single/semi-detached houses in reduced/zero-lot-line development.','Register and maintain the required adjacent-title easement.|Apply the specified paired-wall/gable, gypsum/cladding, soffit and shared-garage separation conditions.|Use a site-specific route if both adjacent buildings cannot follow the policy.|Older-edition PDF remains linked; confirm present applicability with Edmonton.','B:9.10.14.5.(4)','fire-separations-and-spatial-separation housing-secondary-suites-part9 process-and-admin')
