put('edmonton-policy-b19-04-small-building-access','B19-04 – Small Building Access','policy','NBC(AE) 2019',None,'Explains Edmonton emergency-response access expectations for Part 9 and small one-storey Part 3 buildings.','Edmonton Part 9 buildings and one-storey Part 3 buildings up to 600 m².','Provide the specified emergency access path, including the stated 45 m responder-travel limit and access geometry.|Address separately accessed building portions; use the detailed path/route provisions and exceptions.|The source says it does not relax code provisions or settle hydrant distance.','B:3.2.5.5. B:3.2.5.6. B:9.10.20.3.','firefighting-alarms-sprinklers process-and-admin housing-secondary-suites-part9')
