put('edmonton-alternative-solution-secondary-suites-in-row-houses','Alternative Solution for Secondary Suites in Row Houses – Supporting Report','policy','NBC(AE) 2023','2024-07-26','Provides the supporting life-safety/property-protection reasoning referenced by Edmonton B23-01.','The rowhouse/secondary-suite arrangement evaluated in the supporting report.','Read alongside B23-01 and the actual design conditions.|Do not treat another project or a report summary as a separate issued variance.','B:9.10.11.2.','fire-separations-and-spatial-separation housing-secondary-suites-part9 evidence-and-conformity')
