put('edmonton-policy-bulletin-b23-03-roof-truss-engineering','B23-03 – Roof Truss Engineering Requirements','policy','NBC(AE) 2023','2026-02-04','Implements authenticated roof-truss assembly submissions with Edmonton building-permit applications from March 1, 2026.','Single-family/semi-detached houses and three/four-unit rowhouses; detached-garage exceptions are stated.','Provide authenticated assembly information, including interconnections, in the required application documents.|Layout authentication is unnecessary only where all relevant assembly/interface information is already in authenticated documents.|Standard detached garages receive the stated exception unless living/attic-storage/loft space is present.|SOURCE TYPO: opening text calls the STANDATA 23-BCI-05R1; the body identifies 23-BCI-015R1. Verify against the latter official source.','','structural-and-framing professional-involvement process-and-admin')
